Let $\mathbf{v} = \begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ -4 \end{pmatrix}$ be the vector on the line at $t = -2,$ and let $\mathbf{w} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 7 \end{pmatrix}$ be the vector on the line at $t = 3.$  Then the vector on the line at $t = 5$ is
